rall purplish color scheme of the composition.Pet photography, fashion magazine shoots, aidmafluxpro1.1"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 100, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 133, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "title": "CLIP Text Encode (Positive Prompt)", "mode": 0, "size": {"0": 430, "1": 160}, "pos": [390, 190], "id": 6, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 23}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [52], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT"}], "size": {"0": 320, "1": 474}, "pos": [1100, 190], "widgets_values": [1115471026161064, "randomize", 12, 1, "euler", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 61, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 57, "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 104, "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 69, "slot_index": 3, "label": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT"}], "flags": {}, "id": 31, "type": "KSampler", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "KSampler"}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "slot_index": 0, "links": [127], "label": "text", "type": "*"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING"}], "size": {"0": 590, "1": 270}, "pos": [-160, -1130], "widgets_values": ["Please rewrite the following information into an AI painting prompt. The content is a fashion magazine cover photo taken by an anthropomorphic animal model. Keep the description of the animal characteristics and the description of the clothing. The exposed parts of the model's body have animal characteristics. The photo The background is a solid color background that echoes the clothing. \n\nDon't output anything else, such as \"Here's a rewritten AI painting prompt based on the provided information:\"\n\n---\n."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 74, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [126], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING"}], "size": {"0": 590, "1": 310}, "pos": [-160, -450], "widgets_values": ["", "The outfit consists of:\n\n- **Upper Body:** A sleeveless armor-style top primarily in blue with gold accents. Gold sections run along the shoulders, chest, and midsection, giving the appearance of a rigid, structured design.\n- **Lower Body:** Dark blue pants with symmetrical gold patterns on the thighs.\n- **Accessories:** Gold gauntlets covering the forearms and gold armor pieces on the boots. \n- The overall design feels armored, combining a balance of functionality and decorative elements."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 137, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 72, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [141], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING"}], "size": {"0": 280, "1": 142}, "pos": [510, -750], "widgets_values": [", ", "true", "", "", "", ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text_a"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_a", "link": 127, "label": "text_a", "type": "STRING"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_b"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_b", "link": 125, "label": "text_b", "type": "STRING"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_c"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_c", "link": 126, "label": "text_c", "type": "STRING"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_d"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_d", "label": "text_d", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 73, "type": "Text Concatenate", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Text Concatenate"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [131], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING"}], "size": {"0": 590, "1": 310}, "pos": [1150, -750], "widgets_values": [["Paint an anthropomorphic antelope model with brown and white fur, wearing a stylish outfit for a fashion magazine cover. Depict the antelope standing confidently, looking directly at the camera, showcasing its majestic curved horns. Its upper body is clad in a crisp white collared shirt with sleeves extending just below the elbow joints, paired with adjustable black suspenders that add a touch of sophistication. A sleek black tie adds a hint of elegance to the overall look. The model's exposed shoulders and arms display subtle claw marks on its skin, blending seamlessly into the fur. The background is a calming solid green hue that echoes the colors of the shirt, creating a cohesive visual statement."], "Please rewrite the following information into an AI painting prompt. The content is a fashion magazine cover photo taken by an anthropomorphic animal model. Keep the description of the animal characteristics and the description of the clothing. The exposed parts of the model's body have animal characteristics. The photo The background is a solid color background that echoes the clothing. \n\nDon't output anything else, such as \"Here's a rewritten AI painting prompt based on the provided information:\"\n\n---\n., The animal in the picture is a white cat with large, upright ears and heterochromia (one eye is green and the other is blue). It is wearing a light blue fleece outfit with spikes, resembling a dinosaur costume., The outfit consists of:\n\n- **Upper Body:** A sleeveless armor-style top primarily in blue with gold accents. Gold sections run along the shoulders, chest, and midsection, giving the appearance of a rigid, structured design.\n- **Lower Body:** Dark blue pants with symmetrical gold patterns on the thighs.\n- **Accessories:** Gold gauntlets covering the forearms and gold armor pieces on the boots. \n- The overall design feels armored, combining a balance of functionality and decorative elements."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "li